  "title": "关于2026届毕业生申报就业奖励的通知",
  "source_url": "https://my.muc.edu.cn/notice/358402",
  "published_at": "2026-09-02 09:30",
  "content_type": "text",
  "clean_text": "<p style=\";margin-bottom:0;background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">各培养单位、各位2026届毕业生：</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">根据《中央民族大学毕业生就业奖励办法》（民大校发〔2019〕107号），现启动2026届毕业生就业奖励申报工作，具体通知如下。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">一、申请资格条件</span></strong></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">应届统招统分本科毕业生、研究生毕业生（不含定向、委培、少数民族骨干计划学生）；</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">学制内如期取得毕业资格。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">二、奖励标准</span></strong></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">奖励范围和数额执行《中央民族大学毕业生就业奖励办法》，主要奖励类型包括：</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">毕业生到西部地区就业。新疆、西藏、四省涉藏地区少数民族毕业生到其它省区就业；</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">到国际组织实习任职；</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">参军入伍；</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">被各地选调生录取，参加志愿服务西部（不含支教保研）、三支一扶、“美丽中国”支教等服务基层项目就业的。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">具体内容可参照办法。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">三、申报流程</span></strong></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">本次申报时间：即日 — 10月15日17点。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">从中央民族大学就业信息网登录，在线填写申报表格：</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align:start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">网址https://career.muc.edu.cn/，用户名为学号，初始密码为身份证后8位)</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;background: white\">就业信息网登录→个人中心→就业去向管理→就业奖励申请→填写信息、上传就业证明材料扫描件→提交。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;background: white\">就业证明材料应为以下情况之一：三方协议、劳动合同、单位录用证明（需含以下信息：姓名、身份证号、单位名称、单位地址、单位联系方式、入职时间、单位公章）。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">报名完成后经集中审核公示后，对符合条件者发放奖励金。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">三、其它说明</span></strong></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;background:white\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family: 华文仿宋;color:black;background:white\">请务必保证姓名、身份证号、<strong>本人农行卡号</strong>等信息正确性；确保所填农行卡未被注销；</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;background:white\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans SC&#39;,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;color:#3C3C3C\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">请各培养单位通知毕业生。</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;color:#3C3C3C\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">咨询邮箱：[邮箱已脱敏]</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;color:#3C3C3C\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">附件： 《中央民族大学毕业生就业奖励办法》（民大校发〔2019〕107号）</span></p><p style=\";margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:&#39;Calibri&#39;,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;color:#3C3C3C\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:11px;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">招生就业工作处</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:11px;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;text-indent:43px;background:white;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;word-spacing: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size:21px;font-family:仿宋;color:#3C3C3C\">年9月2日</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br/></p>",
